# TqSdk boundary

## Credentials

- Only environment variable names: TQ_USER and TQ_PASS
- Never hardcode usernames, passwords, tokens, or API keys
- Never write real credentials into source, tests, docs, or rules

## Default test behavior

- Default pytest must not require a real TqSdk account
- Default pytest must not perform network calls to Tianqin
- Use monkeypatch, fake env, or stubbed tqsdk modules in unit tests

## Live connection

- Do not import or instantiate real TqApi unless the Issue explicitly allows it
- connect() style APIs must remain opt-in and offline-first in skeleton tasks

## Task boundaries (through TASK-007)

- Adapter skeleton and config wiring only
- Fake env tests and mocked tqsdk only
- No downloader until a later Issue permits it

